{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04959","headline":"奉和幸安乐公主山庄应制 · 马怀素","name":"奉和幸安乐公主山庄应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"主家台沼胜平阳，帝幸欢娱乐未央。\n掩映琱窗交极浦，参差绣户绕回塘。\n泉声百处传歌曲，树影千重对舞行。\n圣酒一沾何以报，唯欣颂德奉时康。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马怀素","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04959.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04959","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}